{
  "_comment": [
    "A plan with six resource changes, deliberately not in alphabetical order by name, and with a tag",
    "value per resource so a query over them resolves to six separate values.",
    "",
    "terraform-plan.json has one resource change, and one resource has no order to get wrong and gives a",
    "query nothing to accumulate. Two things about the Terraform reporter were therefore unreachable from",
    "the fixture corpus: the order its findings are written in, and the truncation of a long `IN`",
    "comparison, whose cut-off can only be crossed when the compared-with side has more than five",
    "elements."
  ],
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "terraform_version": "1.5.0",
  "resource_changes": [
    {
      "address": "aws_s3_bucket.echo",
      "type": "aws_s3_bucket",
